    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 74,
        "text": "Hi, Tom! Are you coming to the community centre open day on Saturday?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "b65186092d7ee89a2fc2797911225b60ce8bfb22af9027a40b9640dfc96293df",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 80,
        "sourceEnd": 150,
        "text": "Yes, I am. I’m helping with the children’s art corner. What about you?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "368e41f93a917ec94442555964f928a7e12252e390ab7cfa42cbb1e39c573212",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 156,
        "sourceEnd": 259,
        "text": "I’m doing the welcome desk from ten to twelve. But I need to leave early because my sister is visiting.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "c98ba51d2aa089a1fcd71747e2d39f6255a65443ef3f5b999198b4e929dfeddf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 265,
        "sourceEnd": 310,
        "text": "Oh, that’s nice. Is she coming from Shanghai?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "63cd598f3dbc1011425b88a603ceeaf75691f7aa05f5790d9f17add71762d92b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 316,
        "sourceEnd": 379,
        "text": "No, she lives in Nanjing now. She’s arriving on Friday evening.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "c6b26ae2bdb90005851ca429fb21547b8042ea860a294aa657257d53d690725b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 385,
        "sourceEnd": 438,
        "text": "I see. So who is covering the welcome desk after you?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "31808f3bb126adea46d93acf2c009f95b5b62fc5b01ec91e7917e5472027a604",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 444,
        "sourceEnd": 498,
        "text": "Mr. Li is. He’s a retired teacher. He’s very friendly.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "099f848a51ec2c06dfe958f8efbbcc16709b68c72df613efb8d52fdbad1eaf29",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 504,
        "sourceEnd": 581,
        "text": "Good. By the way, do you know how many people signed up for the cooking demo?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "8199e74c75be9e2d6ab4bbba7fef0592011fa112edc8b5657fb6dbc037369112",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 587,
        "sourceEnd": 673,
        "text": "I think about thirty. But the room only holds twenty-five, so we might have a problem.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "a0ba52f8f6b0d260589fc6e9e2c8e48e11a6d1fe7383c768ac8a01baf3f32234",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 679,
        "sourceEnd": 751,
        "text": "Really? Let’s tell the organizer. Maybe we can move it to the main hall.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "824e0b2f31853c4e55e9a0e3a1bb9eaca1a860325d80e31806fd2431f7228644",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 757,
        "sourceEnd": 826,
        "text": "Good idea. Also, the art corner needs more paper. Can you bring some?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "3d1d9c9c6fa454e2c49757ec82affca059e25a1b4e75d113263f1c4567eb9801",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 832,
        "sourceEnd": 886,
        "text": "Sure, I’ll bring two packs. Are there enough scissors?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "ba9f547950cf088712b1a5a9159ab9daab93d3180569cdffdad0f0d912475ba4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 892,
        "sourceEnd": 926,
        "text": "I’m not sure. I’ll check tomorrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "8b270b8adffb2eb30849248793422c998fb492644580e359814a304806fcc4e1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 932,
        "sourceEnd": 975,
        "text": "OK. And what time does the open day finish?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "604d3b3de2532b823628756d71062a96c5ad9004caba1ff2df9173a0e852196e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 981,
        "sourceEnd": 1041,
        "text": "At four o’clock. But the clean-up starts at half past three.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "26d1e4e09fda651157778acb831bcfdda2b92d561597b65aead80330adb9ad8b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1047,
        "sourceEnd": 1075,
        "text": "Got it. See you on Saturday!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "50ac7fc9eda4d46892f50398936918e011d64df2c54ce8fd5817ff1a6cb15801",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1081,
        "sourceEnd": 1089,
        "text": "See you!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "b85e335c228acb9216783405b917ea818b8eef57dd9629d259506cb49ea4e519",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
